{"cluster_id": "C-0269", "topic": "blob protocol contract", "target": "architecture/blob-protocol", "member_ids": ["B016-032", "B040-169"], "canonical_claim": "The settled `cas_blob` header fields are `type`, `v`, `tag`, `bld`, `ts`, `by`, `op`, `ch`, and truncated `ref`; `hash_algo`, `domain_id`, `header_hash`, and `writer_version` are dropped, and the header is padded to byte 255 plus `\n` while `blob_header_len` remains 256.; v3 drops cas_blob hash_algo, domain_id, header_hash, writer_version, logical_size, and logical_hash because they are redundant, unvalidated, replaced by ch and bld, or already absent from code", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v3.md#blob-envelope", "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-cas-codecs-v3-design.md#corrected-object-inventory"]}
